    "detailed_description": "<h1>Pre-Purchase Offer</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Support us on Kickstarter! Launching soon! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us on social media, links to the right of the screen. Wishlist to follow us on Steam! <br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333580/extras/a15103ac1a9e77ffedde42d390d3b585.avif?t=1730712574\" /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features \u2705</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2764\ufe0f Build a bond with your Amimon and collect powerful creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0e \ud83c\udfc3 Venture out on a new open world adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc5a Customize your character\u2019s appearance and outfit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae \ud83c\udfae Multiplayer! Play with your friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf3e\ud83c\udfe1Start your own farm in different cities and environments! Build\u00a0 your own\u00a0 welcoming  home for your Amimon! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83e\ude84\u00a0 Battle alongside your Amimon and use the elements to your advantage in team based combat! \ud83d\udd25\ud83c\udf29\ufe0f \ud83c\udf0a\u26f0\ufe0f\u2744\ufe0f\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u26f9\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udc3b Minigames, including Dodgeball with Amimon! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > and more to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333580/extras/d6d5f9c4b9f9cd18939961e18e017599.avif?t=1730712574\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333580/extras/e56f81bd379fa6ca63c72bfe871d88e2.avif?t=1730712574\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333580/extras/poster-girl-ocomory-duosaur.png?t=1730712574\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333580/extras/d65332036baa1920e8c9806365122341.avif?t=1730712574\" /></span></p></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333580/extras/a15103ac1a9e77ffedde42d390d3b585.avif?t=1730712574\" /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features \u2705</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2764\ufe0f Build a bond with your Amimon and collect powerful creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0e \ud83c\udfc3 Venture out on a new open world adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc5a Customize your character\u2019s appearance and outfit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae \ud83c\udfae Multiplayer! Play with your friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf3e\ud83c\udfe1Start your own farm in different cities and environments! Build\u00a0 your own\u00a0 welcoming  home for your Amimon! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83e\ude84\u00a0 Battle alongside your Amimon and use the elements to your advantage in team based combat! \ud83d\udd25\ud83c\udf29\ufe0f \ud83c\udf0a\u26f0\ufe0f\u2744\ufe0f\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u26f9\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udc3b Minigames, including Dodgeball with Amimon! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > and more to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333580/extras/d6d5f9c4b9f9cd18939961e18e017599.avif?t=1730712574\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333580/extras/e56f81bd379fa6ca63c72bfe871d88e2.avif?t=1730712574\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333580/extras/poster-girl-ocomory-duosaur.png?t=1730712574\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333580/extras/d65332036baa1920e8c9806365122341.avif?t=1730712574\" /></span></p>",
